WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:06.960
I've got her scent! This way!

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.320
Shouldn't be much further!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.610
Make sure you capture her!

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.780
What's a strange girl like you doing in a strange place like this?

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.230
Uh, what kind of expression are you supposed to put on at times like these?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:40.970
A classic I once read had a guy say, "Boss, a girl fell from the sky!"

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.940
I don't think that's quite right, Kasukabe.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:44.890
Wait...

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:48.610
Could she be part of the community Shiroyasha mentioned?

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.910
Do you know Shiroyasha?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:53.800
Found her! This way!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.340
Who are you punks?

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:02.250
Don't ya know it's rude to ask someone else's name without introducing yerself first, kid?

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.850
No room for arguments, I see.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.360
We're from the No-Names.

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.230
Allow me to ask once more.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.250
Who are you?

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.780
No-Names?

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:14.630
I get it.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:17.090
Ya couldn't name yourself even if ya wanted to, eh?

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:21.570
He didn't even try to hide the fact!

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.930
Don't ya have any sense of pride or shame?

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:27.600
I can safely assume these guys were chasing you, right?

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:28.920
Y-Yes.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:29.480
That so?

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.900
Then we have a just cause, don't we?

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.730
The four of you team up to chase down one lone girl,

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:39.290
and yet you dare speak of shame? Truly ridiculous!

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:41.910
We No-Names shall make a stand for justice!

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.250
Let's go, Deen!

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:52.500
A huge automaton?

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:53.890
No way!

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.470
How did these nobodies get their hands on a Gift like <i>that</i>?!

00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.430
Go!

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:00.970
Deen!

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:05.540
Don't try to take that thing on!

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.600
Just grab the Sukunabikona girl and run for it!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.310
Did he just say Sukunabikona?

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:23.860
Hang on, Kasukabe.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:24.660
You too, rich girl.

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.860
Sorry about that.

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:30.290
These ladies here ended up attacking you before you could name yourselves.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:33.210
N-Nah, well...

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:37.510
That said, we politely introduced ourselves, and <i>this</i> is how we get treated in return?

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.660
I was just about ready to...

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.930
crush you like this sword.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.520
Look here, dude.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:47.230
Stay put and let us capture you.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.690
